    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this brilliant, extended 3 bed, 2 bath terrace house that has been transformed thanks to a 2 storey extension to rear and an attic conversion with a complete renovation. Cleverly laid out now to make an incredible family home in a quiet cul de sac close to the popular Raheny village.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises hall, open through to open plan livingroom with pocket sliding doors through to large kitchen and extended dining space to rear with large sliding glass door out to the landscaped rear garden.\nOn the first floor there is now 3 bedrooms, ensuite and a large family bathroom incorporating utility room and hotpress. Then, up on the second floor is a smart attic conversion with 2 velux windows and eaves storage.\n\nLocation is ideal. Set in a quiet, mature cul de sac very close to the popular Raheny village with a whole host of amenities including great schools, shops, supermarkets, bars and restaurants. Close to St Annes Park. Host of sports & leisure facilities. Public transport is well catered for with both bus and train to&from Dublin City Centre. Plus, there is the coastal walk & cycleway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.35m x1.40m\nTimber floor\n\nLiving Room - 3.50m x 4.65m\nTimber floor, inset stove, tv point, under stairs storage, pocket sliding doors throught to....\n\nKitchen - 4.95m x 2.70m\nFitted kitchen, quartz countertops, double oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer and dish washer, large island, breakfast counter, recess lights, timber floor.\n\nDining Room - 4.25m x 3.70m\nExtension, timber floor, sliding glass door to rear.\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.75m x 5.65m\nLaminated timber effect floor, sliderobes, recess lights, stairs to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 (rear) - 4.25m x 3.75m\nSliderobes, recess lights, vaulted ceiling, laminated timber effect floor.\n\nEnsuite - 3.10m x 1.00m\nWHB with cabinet, wc, shower, heated towel rail, tiled floor, part tiled wall.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.40m x 3.50m\nLaminated timber effect floor, wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.50m x 2.55m\nLaminated timber effect floor\n\nBathroom - 3.10m x 2.50m\nDouble whb with cabinet, wc, bath with electric shower, plumbed for washing machine, space for tumble dryer, hot presss, tiled floor, part tiled wall, recess lights, extractor fan, heated towel rail.\n\n2nd Floor - \n\n\nAttic - 4.95m x 3.50m\nTongue and grooved timber floor, 2 x velux windows, access to eaves storage, recess lights.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nWalled, paved driveway.\n\nRear Garden - \nPaved patio at back door, steps up to paved patio at rear, fenced lawn, landscaped flowerbeds, steel shed.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>2 storey extension to rear (with FPP)</li><li>Attic conversion</li><li>Open plan living space</li><li>Large bathroom AND an ensuite</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>Landscaped rear garden with patio areas</li><li>Cul de sac</li><li>House: 110.5sqm / 1,190sqft approx.</li><li>Attic: 17.5sqm / 188sqft approx.</li><li>Total: 128.0sqm / 1,378sqft approx.</ul>"
      },
